  "reply": "To route a lab result to a covering physician: 1) Go to **Clinical > Lab Queue**. 2) Open the pending result from the unreviewed list. 3) Click **Delegate**, choose the covering provider from the dropdown, and click **Send**. If the covering provider (e.g., Dr. Smith) does not appear, verify their active coverage schedule under **Settings > Staff**. Ensure any required annotations are entered so the **Sign Off** button is enabled."
}
